{"code":0,"msg":"ok","data":{"actions":[{"name":"ai.actions.list","title":"","desc":"列出当前 Token 可调用的全部操作及参数 Schema","rw":"read","permission":"","module":"core:aiapi","is_delete":0,"params":{"type":"object","properties":{}},"source_plugin":"aiapi"},{"name":"help.tutorial.search","title":"教程·搜索","desc":"用户问后台怎么用、某功能在哪、操作步骤时，先调用本接口。keyword 用用户的原话或功能名，例如商品、订单、签到、提现。不传 keyword 时只返回教程分类。回答必须依据返回的教程，不要编造步骤。需要全文时再调用 help.tutorial.get","rw":"read","permission":"HelpCenterProgress\/index","module":"core:help","is_delete":0,"params":{"type":"object","properties":{"keyword":{"type":"string","description":"功能名或问题，如 商品管理、怎么发货"},"limit":{"type":"integer","default":8}}},"source_plugin":"aiapi"},{"name":"help.tutorial.get","title":"教程·详情","desc":"读取一篇后台使用教程的正文、后台入口 link_url 和视频或外链 tutorial_url。先用 help.tutorial.search 拿到 id。用中文按教程步骤回答，并告诉用户去哪个页面操作","rw":"read","permission":"HelpCenterProgress\/index","module":"core:help","is_delete":0,"params":{"type":"object","required":["id"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"integer"}}},"source_plugin":"aiapi"},{"name":"shop.category.list","title":"","desc":"商品分类列表","rw":"read","permission":"ShopCategory\/index","module":"core:shop","is_delete":0,"params":{"type":"object","properties":{"pid":{"type":"integer","description":"父分类ID，可选"}}},"source_plugin":"aiapi"},{"name":"shop.category.create","title":"","desc":"创建商品分类","rw":"write","permission":"ShopCategory\/edit","module":"core:shop","is_delete":0,"params":{"type":"object","required":["name"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"pid":{"type":"integer","default":0},"pic":{"type":"string"},"sort":{"type":"integer"},"status":{"type":"integer","enum":[0,1]},"dry_run":{"type":"boolean"}}},"source_plugin":"aiapi"},{"name":"shop.category.update","title":"商品·分类更新","desc":"更新商品分类名称、父级、图片、排序或状态","rw":"write","permission":"ShopCategory\/edit","module":"core:shop","is_delete":0,"params":{"type":"object","required":["id"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"integer"},"name":{"type":"string"},"pid":{"type":"integer"},"pi